ase_seconds": 5.0, "min_green_cap_seconds": 60.0, "absolute_safety_min_seconds": 4.0, "sec_per_car": 2.5, "switch_min_vehicles": 3, "switch_min_wait_seconds": 25.0, "demand_ratio_to_preempt": 0.4, "queue_threshold": 1, "gap_out_seconds": 3.0, "flow_speed_threshold": 1.0, "platoon_min_moving": 2, "starvation_override_seconds": 90.0, "all_red_seconds": 2.0, "camera_range_meters": 150.0, "stop_line_zone_meters": 50.0}, "training_device_preference": "auto", "training_device": "privateuseone:0", "training_device_label": "directml"}
